# Manual safety copies taken before destructive runs. `*.db` does NOT match
# these — the suffix comes after the extension (startup_radar.db.bak-2026-09-02)
# — so without this line a `git add -A` would push the full job database.
*.db.bak-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
connections.csv
LinkedIn*.csv
